---
description: Execute an isolated batch bugfix lane
mode: subagent
model: "openai/gpt-6.1-sol"
thinking: high
tools: bash
params:
  manifest_path: string
---
// This prompt-mode invocation runs in this lane's PRIVATE conversation. The
// controller-validated batch manifest gives /fix-bug its own lease/worktree and
// forces ship false. No model is asked to improvise or reimplement the workflow.
// Completion text is diagnostic only; the parent independently checks persisted
// final gates, review binding, decisions and exact checkout before integration.
invoke<string>("../fix-bug.theta", "batch " + manifest_path)?
